From 288ac47efb17d69e4818559b7135fc7a46fb0889 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willian Z <willian@willian.email>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:18:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Allow ZedLink to expose multiple projects

Add zedlink.project_roots alongside project_root. Each thread is confined to the configured root that is one of its own folders, so file reads, search, Git, terminals and tasks never cross into another listed project. Unusable roots are skipped with a warning instead of disabling the bridge.
